        "Em kẹt xe."
      ],
      "explain": {
        "fr": "ghét : détester. hết : fini.",
        "en": "ghét: to hate. hết: over, finished."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "listen_pick_image",
      "concept": "c_sau_rieng",
      "distractors": [
        "c_chuoi",
        "c_dua_hau"
      ],
      "explain": {
        "fr": "sầu riêng : le durian, on l'adore ou on le déteste.",
